00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:50,000
Little Lord Fauntleroy is a family, drama, tv movie film directed by Jack Gold.

3
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:42,000
Young Cedric Errol and his widowed mother live in genteel poverty
in 1880s Brooklyn after the death of his father.

4
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:34,000
Cedric's grandfather, the Earl of Dorincourt, has long ago
disowned his son for marrying an American.

5
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:26,000
But after the death of the Earl's remaining son, he
decides to accept Cedric as his heir.

6
